rone Core Command v0.64\n\nNew\n- Heavy push on optimization\n\nKnown Bugs\n- Some art assets are still in progress given the new performance push\n\nFuture\n- continued optimizations\n- systems balancing still in progress so any feedback here is appreciated\n- XR gameplay is in development, but not ready for release into production channel yet.", "created_date": 1777668943, "id": "26438033285825268", "version": "0.64", "version_code": 64, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}